  "instructions_md": "# AST Code Transformer & Refactorer\n\nHigh-precision Python and TypeScript AST code transformations with zero regex hallucinations.\n\n## Architecture\n\nUses Python's `ast` parser and TypeScript compiler API to refactor classes, methods, and types with zero unintended side-effects.\n\n## Execution\n\n```python\nimport ast\n\ndef transform_ast(tree):\n    # AST visitor & transformer\n    return tree\n```\n",
